{{define "privacy.tmpl"}}
<article class="space-y-4 text-sm text-ink-muted">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-ink-primary">Privacy Policy &amp; Advertising Disclosure</h1>
  <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> November 2026 &bull; <strong>Operator:</strong> New Vision Gaming LLC</p>
  <p>
    New Vision Gaming provides free-to-play classic strategy games across Web/PWA and upcoming iOS/Android mobile apps,
    supported by advertising partners (Google AdSense / H5 Games Ads on Web; Google AdMob SDK on Native Mobile Apps)
    and hosted on Google Firebase and Cloud Run infrastructure.
  </p>
  <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-primary">1. Data We Collect</h2>
  <p>
    Single-player and local games require no account creation. Optional multiplayer rooms and saved profiles use
    anonymous-first Firebase Authentication (upgradable to Sign in with Apple or Google). Server security audit logs
    record minimal technical telemetry (timestamp, move validity, HTTP status) for reliability and anti-cheat defense.
  </p>
  <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-primary">2. Advertising, Cookies &amp; Consent (GDPR / CCPA / ATT / COPPA)</h2>
  <p>
    On the Web, when advertising is enabled, Google AdSense uses cookies or local storage subject to regional consent
    (EEA/UK/California CMP). On Native iOS and Android apps, web AdSense is disabled and ads are served exclusively via
    the native Google AdMob SDK respecting Apple App Tracking Transparency (ATT) and Google Play Families policies.
    Our games are designed for general audiences and do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13 (COPPA).
  </p>
  <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-primary">3. Account &amp; Data Deletion</h2>
  <p>
    Players with an optional saved profile may delete their account and all associated profile data at any time directly
    in-app or by emailing <strong>privacy@newvisiongaming.example</strong>. Anonymous game rooms expire automatically.
  </p>
  <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-ink-primary">4. Authorized Digital Sellers</h2>
  <p>
    Web sellers: <a href="/ads.txt" class="text-accent-primary underline">/ads.txt</a> &bull;
    Mobile App sellers (AdMob): <a href="/app-ads.txt" class="text-accent-primary underline">/app-ads.txt</a>.
  </p>
</article>
{{end}}
